      "content": "it's just weird how much sense that makes when you actually think about it. like, if the most logical thing to do is to align with the natural direction of things... then why is there such a huge pressure to keep pushing through the pain? it feels like staying alive is just choosing to endure unnecessary suffering when a peaceful, quiet stasis is the only actual truth. it's like we're being told to stay in a burning house just because we haven't reached the temperature of the outside yet. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just... stop?",
